            "value": " and "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Bar"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " classes as placeholders so that you can concentrate on the transaction usage without focusing on a particular domain model. For the purposes of this example, the fact that the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "DefaultFooService"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " class throws "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "UnsupportedOperationException"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " instances in the body of each implemented method is good. That behavior lets you see transactions being created and then rolled back in response to the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "UnsupportedOperationException"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " instance. The following listing shows the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "FooService"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " interface:"
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
